--[[
================================================================================

        H E L L I S H   T I M E   E V E R

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/main/HellishTimeEver"))()

            K   one random entity. Never the same one twice.
            J   reset: every entity can come again, from speed 60.

        Run it inside a DOORS run. It adds "Hellish Time Ever" to DOORS' own
        modifier panel -- in black and white, moving -- next to any modifiers
        you already picked.

        WHY NO REPEATS
        --------------
        Spam K in a video and pure random gives you three Rushes in a row.
        This is a bag, not dice: every entity is in it once, K pulls one out,
        and it does not go back in until you press J. Eight presses, eight
        different entities.

        EACH ONE FASTER
        ---------------
        The first comes at speed 60 -- where 100 is Rush's normal pace -- and
        every one after it is SPEED_STEP faster than the last. J starts the
        climb again from 60.

        WHERE THE ENTITIES COME FROM
        ----------------------------
        Nothing is inside this script. Each one is loaded when it is summoned:

            Rush, Ambush     Vynixu's own models, from the Entity Spawner repo
            A-60, A-120,     your models from Roblox Studio, exported to the
            Scribble, Bash,  HTE/ folder of this repo with their sounds
            Blitz
            Honcho           Honcho.lua from this repo, which runs itself

        HOW THE MODIFIER IS SHOWN
        -------------------------
        Built from DOORS' own panel, not an imitation of it. When a run starts
        with modifiers, DOORS clones MainUI.Modifiers, adds one row per
        modifier, writes "N MODIFIERS ACTIVATED" and slides it out after ten
        seconds. This does the same thing, with the same pieces.

        It does NOT add Hellish Time Ever to DOORS' modifier list itself.
        DOORS reads every active modifier's knob bonus from its own table, and
        a name that is not in that table would crash DOORS' own script.

================================================================================
]]

